{# Fixture for the comment cases: a tag template whose comments speak of its markers - the
   caller's content lands at @content@, an empty list shows its @else@ part, the rows go
   between @start@ and @end@ - where only the markers outside them are the template's. #}
{-- the same in the dash form: @content@, @else@, @start@ and @end@ --}<div>@start@[@content@]@end@</div>
